at these were submitted by teenagers.\par \par \uc2 See them, Gayle?\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: Yes. Is that a spider there?\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: Well, so all right. So most have traditional voting related themes, but 14-year-old Hudson Rowan, blew the other five out of the water.\par \par \uc2 Gayle is like, "Is that a spider?\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: Is that a spider?\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: He drew this creepy looking psychedelic spider.\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: Look at the eyes.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: And this bizarre design won. You want to know how many votes?\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: How many?\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: Two hundred and twenty-eight thousand votes.\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: Wow.\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: No way.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: Go, Hudson. Yes. So the elections were followed through and made the sticker which is a huge hit.\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: I like it.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: I know, it is very cool.\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: Is that what he says when looks at politicians?\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: Look, look, somebody got a tattoo, Vlad?\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: So some got a tattoo. They loved it so much. This woman who loved it got it tattooed on her arm.\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: I voted.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: Very cool.\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: Yes, go, Hudson.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: Go, Hudson. Go, Hudson.\par \par \uc2 All right, we`re doing a big reveal.\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: Okay.\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: Okay.\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: Big reveal.\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: What have you got?\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: A superhero is doing a big flex because "People" Magazine has just announced this year`s Sexiest Man Alive.\par \par \uc2 GAYLE KING: Is it Vlad Duthiers?\par \par \uc2 VLADIMIR DUTHIERS: Thank you very much. No, it`s not.\par \par \uc2 Everybody --\par \par \uc2 NATE BURLESON: You see 